  "timeline": [
    {
      "text": "His fishing boat sank off Admiralty Island, Alaska, and the life raft he escaped into started taking on water.",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 7.063
    },
    {
      "text": "A Coast Guard Jayhawk crew from Air Station Sitka flew to him, about two miles east of Murder Cove.",
      "start": 7.283,
      "end": 13.5
    },
    {
      "text": "In a hoist like this, the pilots cannot see straight down. The flight mechanic in the open door talks them into position, foot by foot.",
      "start": 13.72,
      "end": 22.225
    },
    {
      "text": "The same crew member runs the cable, lowering help and lifting people back up into the cabin.",
      "start": 22.445,
      "end": 27.821
    },
    {
      "text": "The Sitka aircrew hoisted the boater up and aboard the Jayhawk.",
      "start": 28.041,
      "end": 31.62
    }
  ],
